' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "System" as Actor
participant "Handover Response Evaluation" as Page
participant "Appointment Service" as Service
participant "return_appointments" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Evaluate responses inside authorized appointment action
activate Page
Page -> Service: 2: Run task with current eligible context
activate Service
Service -> Table: 3: Lock appointment and participant response snapshot
activate Table
Table --> Service: 4: Finder/owner responses
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 5: Record explicit CONFIRMED or DISPUTED response
alt Not both valid positive responses
Service -> Table: 6: Keep ACCEPTED attempt; persist pending/mismatched responses
activate Table
Table --> Service: 7: Uncompleted appointment
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 8: Write immutable action event; require explicit correction/review
Service --> Page: 9: Pending/mismatched handover retained
Page --> Actor: 10: Record task outcome
else Both positive but safety recheck fails
Service -> Service: 6.1: Do not complete; retain reviewable history
Service --> Page: 6.2: Task not completed; bounded retry / report failure
Page --> Actor: 6.3: Record failure without reporting success
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: This diagram covers the non-completion branch; both safe positive responses use UC-139. No
automatic return or silent cancellation.
endlegend
